# The static gates of `npm run check` (typecheck, lint, i18n, wp) run before
# every commit. The commit hook used to run only `lint`, so a type error was
# committed locally and only the CI typecheck found it. The gate is the same
# script CI runs, so a green commit can no longer be red in GitHub (PLAN.md §18.1).
npm run check:static
node scripts/version-file.mjs
